TabbyAPI: tool_format deepseek_v41, the DSML tool-call spelling of DeepSeek-V4.1.

Against TabbyAPI e632af41 (2026-08-13). Adds endpoints/OAI/utils/toolcall_formats/deepseek_v41.py (a copy of
deepseek_v4.py with V4.1's spelling: a space after the DSML token, 'calls' for 'tool_calls') and registers it as
deepseek_v41 / dsv41. This patch modifies TabbyAPI and is under TabbyAPI's license.
Apply in the TabbyAPI checkout with: patch -p1 < tabby-deepseek_v41-toolformat.patch (or git apply).

